{"key": "[\"Chandragupta Maurya overthrows the Nanda king and takes Magadha. The Greeks call him Sandrokottos. Indian stories written centuries later give the plan to a minister, Chanakya. His capital is Pataliputra, walled in timber where the Son meets the Ganga. An envoy of Seleucus will describe it.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/chandragupta-magadha.mp3", "duration": 20.434042, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "Chandragupta"}, {"t": 0.4442183043478261, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "Maurya"}, {"t": 0.8884366086956522, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "overthrows"}, {"t": 1.3326549130434784, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "the"}, {"t": 1.7768732173913044, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "Nanda"}, {"t": 2.2210915217391305, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "king"}, {"t": 2.6653098260869568, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "and"}, {"t": 3.1095281304347826, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "takes"}, {"t": 3.553746434782609, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "Magadha."}, {"t": 3.997964739130435, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "The"}, {"t": 4.442183043478261, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "Greeks"}, {"t": 4.886401347826087, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "call"}, {"t": 5.3306196521739135, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "him"}, {"t": 5.77483795652174, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "Sandrokottos."}, {"t": 6.219056260869565, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "Indian"}, {"t": 6.6632745652173915, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "stories"}, {"t": 7.107492869565218, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "written"}, {"t": 7.551711173913044, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "centuries"}, {"t": 7.99592947826087, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "later"}, {"t": 8.440147782608696, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "give"}, {"t": 8.884366086956522, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "the"}, {"t": 9.328584391304348, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w": "plan"}, {"t": 9.772802695652175, "d": 0.4442183043478261, "w